# Trace metals: solar C, N, O (Asplund+2009 number ratios to H).
# Each value is the TOTAL element abundance n_X/n_H (all ionization
# stages summed); the ionization-equilibrium solver distributes it over
# the ion stages.
# With 'Molecular chemistry: True' in input.inp these stages are solved
# in the SAME system as H2/H2+/H3+/HeH+ (System_HeH_mol_metals): the two
# blocks share the free electron density, which the metals dominate in
# the shielded molecular base.
C     2.69e-4
N     6.76e-5
O     4.90e-4
